    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0054",
      "text": "3.03 Weekly Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 304.994,
        "x1": 95.879,
        "bottom": 311.994
      },
      "reading_order": 54,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0055",
      "text": "200",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 244.758,
        "top": 306.424,
        "x1": 254.629,
        "bottom": 313.424
      },
      "reading_order": 55,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0056",
      "text": "M8",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 284.576,
        "top": 306.424,
        "x1": 292.864,
        "bottom": 313.424
      },
      "reading_order": 56,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0057",
      "text": "13.5Nm",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 317.593,
        "top": 306.424,
        "x1": 337.9,
        "bottom": 313.424
      },
      "reading_order": 57,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0058",
      "text": "• As Daily Checks.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 317.894,
        "x1": 75.129,
        "bottom": 324.894
      },
      "reading_order": 58,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0059",
      "text": "370",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 244.758,
        "top": 319.924,
        "x1": 254.629,
        "bottom": 326.924
      },
      "reading_order": 59,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0060",
      "text": "M8",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 284.576,
        "top": 319.924,
        "x1": 292.864,
        "bottom": 326.924
      },
      "reading_order": 60,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0061",
      "text": "13.5Nm",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 317.593,
        "top": 319.924,
        "x1": 337.9,
        "bottom": 326.924
      },
      "reading_order": 61,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0062",
      "text": "• Remove end cover of pump and inspect Impeller for signs of",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 329.174,
        "x1": 182.978,
        "bottom": 336.174
      },
      "reading_order": 62,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0063",
      "text": "End cover and Body Bolt Torque",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 249.574,
        "top": 332.32,
        "x1": 326.426,
        "bottom": 339.32
      },
      "reading_order": 63,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0064",
      "text": "damage or wear. Repair or replace as necessary.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 337.574,
        "x1": 151.729,
        "bottom": 344.574
      },
      "reading_order": 64,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0065",
      "text": "5.01 End cover",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 347.349,
        "x1": 258.191,
        "bottom": 354.349
      },
      "reading_order": 65,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0066",
      "text": "3.04 Monthly Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 350.313,
        "x1": 98.875,
        "bottom": 357.313
      },
      "reading_order": 66,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0067",
      "text": "Before removing the end cover, ensure the pump & drive are",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 358.629,
        "x1": 354.235,
        "bottom": 365.629
      },
      "reading_order": 67,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0068",
      "text": "• As Weekly Checks.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 363.213,
        "x1": 80.624,
        "bottom": 370.213
      },
      "reading_order": 68,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0069",
      "text": "isolated; the pump is cool enough to safely touch, drained of any",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 367.029,
        "x1": 364.853,
        "bottom": 374.029
      },
      "reading_order": 69,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0070",
      "text": "• Visually check Impeller for damage or wear and seal housing",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 374.493,
        "x1": 183.753,
        "bottom": 381.493
      },
      "reading_order": 70,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0071",
      "text": "fluids (take special care with hazardous fluids) and ensure that",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 375.429,
        "x1": 358.092,
        "bottom": 382.429
      },
      "reading_order": 71,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0072",
      "text": "for leaks.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 382.893,
        "x1": 57.895,
        "bottom": 389.893
      },
      "reading_order": 72,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0073",
      "text": "pump and seal flushing systems are isolated and depressurized.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 383.829,
        "x1": 363.153,
        "bottom": 390.829
      },
      "reading_order": 73,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0074",
      "text": "3.05 Six Monthly Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 395.631,
        "x1": 110.992,
        "bottom": 402.631
      },
      "reading_order": 74,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0075",
      "text": "ATTENTION",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 400.814,
        "x1": 270.056,
        "bottom": 407.814
      },
      "reading_order": 75,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0076",
      "text": "• As Monthly Checks.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 408.531,
        "x1": 83.361,
        "bottom": 415.531
      },
      "reading_order": 76,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0077",
      "text": "The end cover is heavy; take care to support it during",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 409.214,
        "x1": 368.013,
        "bottom": 416.214
      },
      "reading_order": 77,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0078",
      "text": "removal.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 229.68,
        "top": 417.614,
        "x1": 252.983,
        "bottom": 424.614
      },
      "reading_order": 78,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0079",
      "text": "• Change end cover O-ring or end cover gasket.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 419.811,
        "x1": 146.92,
        "bottom": 426.811
      },
      "reading_order": 79,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0080",
      "text": "• Remove Impeller for visual inspection and signs of wear if so",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 431.091,
        "x1": 183.612,
        "bottom": 438.091
      },
      "reading_order": 80,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0081",
      "text": "• Loosen all bolts holding end cover to body. Check end cover",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 434.492,
        "x1": 361.107,
        "bottom": 441.492
      },
      "reading_order": 81,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0082",
      "text": "replace.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 439.491,
        "x1": 55.299,
        "bottom": 446.491
      },
      "reading_order": 82,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0083",
      "text": "moves freely and if it is stuck tap carefully sideways with a soft",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 442.892,
        "x1": 366.434,
        "bottom": 449.892
      },
      "reading_order": 83,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0084",
      "text": "• Visual inspection of shaft, clean if required.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 450.771,
        "x1": 140.843,
        "bottom": 457.771
      },
      "reading_order": 84,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0085",
      "text": "hammer, do not lever off.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 451.292,
        "x1": 277.578,
        "bottom": 458.292
      },
      "reading_order": 85,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0086",
      "text": "• Inspect seal faces for wear and condition of elastomers.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 462.051,
        "x1": 169.95,
        "bottom": 469.051
      },
      "reading_order": 86,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0087",
      "text": "• Once end cover loose, remove bolts completely while support-",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 462.572,
        "x1": 367.176,
        "bottom": 469.572
      },
      "reading_order": 87,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0088",
      "text": "Replace as necessary or note for planned maintenance.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 470.451,
        "x1": 169.888,
        "bottom": 477.451
      },
      "reading_order": 88,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0089",
      "text": "ing end cover.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 470.972,
        "x1": 250.481,
        "bottom": 477.972
      },
      "reading_order": 89,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0090",
      "text": "• Place end cover to side and clean if required.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 482.252,
        "x1": 324.903,
        "bottom": 489.252
      },
      "reading_order": 90,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0091",
      "text": "3.06 Annual Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 483.19,
        "x1": 94.423,
        "bottom": 490.19
      },
      "reading_order": 91,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0092",
      "text": "• Remove o-ring, check for wear and replace if required.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 493.532,
        "x1": 347.401,
        "bottom": 500.532
      },
      "reading_order": 92,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0093",
      "text": "• Change mechanical seals if fitted, and if required.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 496.09,
        "x1": 156.831,
        "bottom": 503.09
      },
      "reading_order": 93,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0094",
      "text": "5.02 Impeller",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 507.311,
        "x1": 252.997,
        "bottom": 514.311
      },
      "reading_order": 94,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0095",
      "text": "• Change O-rings and/or gaskets on pump head.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 507.37,
        "x1": 150.098,
        "bottom": 514.37
      },
      "reading_order": 95,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0096",
      "text": "• Check bearing wear on Pedestal units by seeing if there is any",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 518.65,
        "x1": 186.084,
        "bottom": 525.65
      },
      "reading_order": 96,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0097",
      "text": "• Remove the impeller using the correct size Jabsco impeller",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 520.211,
        "x1": 359.344,
        "bottom": 527.211
      },
      "reading_order": 97,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0098",
      "text": "movement of the shaft side to side or forwards and backwards.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 527.05,
        "x1": 187.939,
        "bottom": 534.05
      },
      "reading_order": 98,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0099",
      "text": "removal tool. Alternatively, the pump body can be removed",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 528.611,
        "x1": 360.239,
        "bottom": 535.611
      },
      "reading_order": 99,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0100",
      "text": "If movement is perceived dismantle bearings for inspection,",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 535.45,
        "x1": 182.445,
        "bottom": 542.45
      },
      "reading_order": 100,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0101",
      "text": "from the adaptor/bearing housing and impeller changed per",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 537.011,
        "x1": 363.944,
        "bottom": 544.011
      },
      "reading_order": 101,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0102",
      "text": "replace along with Lip Seals if necessary.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 543.85,
        "x1": 134.425,
        "bottom": 550.85
      },
      "reading_order": 102,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0103",
      "text": "clamped versions.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 545.411,
        "x1": 260.184,
        "bottom": 552.411
      },
      "reading_order": 103,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0104",
      "text": "• Impeller should be pulled along the axis of the pump body.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 556.691,
        "x1": 361.205,
        "bottom": 563.691
      },
      "reading_order": 104,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0105",
      "text": "By ensuring a visual inspection daily and regular checks at",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 557.579,
        "x1": 168.585,
        "bottom": 564.579
      },
      "reading_order": 105,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0106",
      "text": "planned intervals, pumps can be maintained to maximum",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 565.979,
        "x1": 168.903,
        "bottom": 572.979
      },
      "reading_order": 106,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0107",
      "text": "• Twisting the impeller in the direction of pump rotation will",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 207.0,
        "top": 567.971,
        "x1": 358.286,
        "bottom": 574.971
      },
      "reading_order": 107,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0108",
      "text": "performance for many years.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 27.0,
        "top": 574.379,
        "x1": 96.684,
        "bottom": 581.379
      },
      "reading_order": 108,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0109",
      "text": "assist in removal.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 216.0,
        "top": 576.371,
        "x1": 258.055,
        "bottom": 583.371
      },
      "reading_order": 109,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP016:p0005:b0110",
      "text": "5",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 196.17,
        "top": 587.476,
        "x1": 199.83,
        "bottom": 593.476
      },
      "reading_order": 110,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    }
  ],
